{"id":"poursuite","lemma":"poursuite","pos":"noun","rank":3072,"glosses":["pursuit; chase","pursuit","prosecution"],"ipa":"/puʁ.sɥit/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/89/Fr-poursuite.ogg/Fr-poursuite.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"poursuites"},"examples":[{"text":"Je veux engager des poursuites.","en":"I want to press charges.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to pledge, commit"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Toutes les poursuites ont été abandonnées.","en":"All the charges have been dropped.","words":[{"g":"all","l":"tout"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"given up, abandoned","l":"abandonné"}]},{"text":"J'engage des poursuites.","en":"I'm pressing charges.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to pledge, commit","l":"engager"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Je suis en train d'engager des poursuites.","en":"I'm pressing charges.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"train"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to pledge, commit"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"Un trou dans la législation lui a permis d'échapper à des poursuites.","en":"A loophole in the law allowed him to escape prosecution.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"hole"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"legislation"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"permit, licence"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to escape , evade"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]}]}